  "glow_from": "RenderKanturu1stMonsterObjectMesh MODEL_SPLINTER_WOLF (GM_Kanturu_1st.cpp:954-964), BodyLight 1: meshes 0, 1 and 4 (the body, fur and tail) plain; meshes 2 and 3 (splinterwolfef_R, splinterwolfef01_R) drawn only RENDER_TEXTURE | RENDER_BRIGHT, added, at fLumi = (sin(WorldTime * 0.002) + 1) * 0.5, a slow breath from dark to full over about 3 s. Ours: both drawn as glows only, pulse 0.5 +- 0.5 at the half rate (WorldTime * 0.002).",
